Anime-style wide illustration, clean line art, soft cel shading, gentle natural colours, cinematic composition, no text, no letters, no readable marks. Entirely underwater, clear green water, no sky, no horizon. A vast round bowl a kilometre across sunk in white sand, built of plain smooth pale stone terraces in many tiers curving up all around; every stone wall completely plain and smooth, with no carvings, no inscriptions, no symbols, no marks of any kind. Every tier is filled with a crowd of people, small figures in dark and pale sea-silk robes sitting shoulder to shoulder, thousands upon thousands, seen from above across the bowl. At the centre of the empty white sand floor stands a small knot of a few tiny figures. Sunlight nets of light from above on the stone. Grave, huge, hushed mood.
